  (103, true, '103|||אפליקציה/מדריך דיגיטלי להתמודדות עם PTSD, מטעם אגף השיקום (משרד הביטחון).', '103|||אפליקציה של אגף השיקום, עם מידע וכלים להתמודדות עצמית עם פוסט־טראומה. היא אינה אבחון ואינה פסיכותרפיה.', '{"whatsapp":"","whatsappLabel":"","cost":"","founded":"","meeting":"","specialty":"פוסט־טראומה","approaches":"מיינדפולנס, מדיטציה, NLP","notes":"אפשר להשתמש בה לבד או לצד טיפול אצל איש מקצוע. בחלק ממכשירי אנדרואיד חדשים אי אפשר כרגע להוריד אותה.","target":"מי שמתמודד עם פוסט־טראומה","region":"","org":"המדריך ל-PTSD","svc":"אפליקציה של אגף השיקום, עם מידע וכלים להתמודדות עצמית עם פוסט־טראומה. היא אינה אבחון ואינה פסיכותרפיה.","phone":"","phoneLabel":"","phoneShowNumber":false,"phone2":"","phoneLabel2":"","phoneShowNumber2":false,"phone3":"","phoneLabel3":"","phoneShowNumber3":false,"phone4":"","phoneLabel4":"","phoneShowNumber4":false,"phone5":"","phoneLabel5":"","phoneShowNumber5":false,"phone6":"","phoneLabel6":"","phoneShowNumber6":false,"email":"","emailLabel":"","emailShowAddress":false,"email2":"","emailLabel2":"","emailShowAddress2":false,"email3":"","emailLabel3":"","emailShowAddress3":false}'::jsonb, '{"whatsapp":"","whatsappLabel":"","cost":"","founded":"","meeting":"","specialty":"Post-trauma","approaches":"Mindfulness, meditation, NLP","notes":"You can use it on its own or alongside treatment with a professional. On some newer Android phones it cannot be downloaded for now.","target":"People coping with post-trauma","region":"","org":"The PTSD Guide","svc":"A rehabilitation-department app, with information and self-help tools for post-trauma. It is not an assessment and it is not psychotherapy.","phone":"","phoneLabel":"","phone2":"","phoneLabel2":"","phone3":"","phoneLabel3":"","phone4":"","phoneLabel4":"","phone5":"","phoneLabel5":"","phone6":"","phoneLabel6":"","email":"","emailLabel":"","email2":"","emailLabel2":"","email3":"","emailLabel3":""}'::jsonb, '23.11.2026: נבדק מול https://shikum.mod.gov.il/medical/mental-therapy/ptsd-app. הניסוח אושר 