  (211, true, '211|||טיפול, ליווי ושיקום לפוסט-טראומה (בהכרה או לאחר אבחון) — חוות במושב שמש', '211|||טיפול פרטני וקבוצתי ללוחמים ולמילואימניקים אחרי המלחמה. בחווה.', '{"whatsapp":"","whatsappLabel":"","cost":"בסבסוד מלא של אגף השיקום, למתאימים","founded":"","meeting":"in_person","specialty":"","approaches":"רכיבה טיפולית, חקלאות טיפולית, יוגה, כלבנות טיפולית, קרב מגע","notes":"יש גם מסלול למי שהוכרו מאז מלחמות קודמות. בדף של מסלול משרד הביטחון הצוות כולל פסיכולוגים, עובדים סוציאליים ופסיכיאטרים. הסיכה על המפה מסומנת מושב שמש.","target":"לוחמים ומילואימניקים שחוו את המלחמה","region":"גבעת שמש","org":"רטורנו — חוות החוסן","svc":"טיפול פרטני וקבוצתי ללוחמים ולמילואימניקים אחרי המלחמה. בחווה.","phone":"058-6000881","phoneLabel":"טלפון","phoneShowNumber":false,"phone2":"052-3776879","phoneLabel2":"מלחמות קודמות","phoneShowNumber2":false,"phone3":"","phoneLabel3":"","phoneShowNumber3":false,"phone4":"","phoneLabel4":"","phoneShowNumber4":false,"phone5":"","phoneLabel5":"","phoneShowNumber5":false,"phone6":"","phoneLabel6":"","phoneShowNumber6":false,"email":"lilach@retorno.org","emailLabel":"אימייל","emailShowAddress":false,"email2":"","emailLabel2":"","emailShowAddress2":false,"email3":"","emailLabel3":"","emailShowAddress3":false}'::jsonb, '{"whatsapp":"","whatsappLabel":"","cost":"Fully subsidized by the Rehabilitation Department, for those who qualify","founded":"","meeting":"in_person","specialty":"","approaches":"Therapeutic riding, therapeutic farming, yoga, therapeutic dog work, krav maga","notes":"There is also a track for people recognized from earlier wars. On the Ministry of Defense track page, the team includes psychologists, social workers, and psychiatrists. The map pin is labeled Moshav Shemesh.","target":"Combat soldiers and reservists who went through the war","region":"Givat Shemesh","org":"Retorno – Havat HaHosen","svc":"Individual and group treatment for combat soldiers and reservists after the war. At the farm.","phone":"058-6000881","phoneLabel":"Phone","phone2":"052-3776879","phoneLabel2":"Earlier wars","phone3":"","phoneLabel3":"","phone4":"","phoneLabel4":"","phone5":"","phoneLabel5":"","phone6":"","phoneLabel6":"","email":"lilach@retorno.org","emailLabel":"Email","email2":"","emailLabel2":"","email3":"","emailLabel3":""}'::jsonb, '23.11.2026: נבדק מול https://retorno.org.il/חוות-החוסן/ ו-https://retorno.org.il/חוות-החוסן-מלחמות-קודמות/. הניסוח אושר עם אצוות הטראומה.'),
